# ===========================================================================
#  .gitignore — Active Directory Home Lab
#  Goal: keep documentation (.md), screenshots (.png), scripts (.ps1) and
#  newusers.csv tracked, while keeping secrets and large VM artifacts OUT.
# ===========================================================================

# --- Secrets / credentials -------------------------------------------------
LabPasswords.txt
# Broad guard: ANY .txt may hold passwords, DSRM keys, or scratch notes.
# (This also excludes the harmless Story.txt / re-enable reminder notes —
#  move them to .md if you want them tracked.)
*.txt

# Common credential / key file types
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.cer
secrets.*
*.secret

# --- Logs ------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log

# --- OS cruft --------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- VM images / large binary artifacts ------------------------------------
*.vdi
*.vhd
*.vhdx
*.iso
*.ova
*.ovf
*.vmdk
*.nvram

# ===========================================================================
#  Intentionally TRACKED (do not ignore):
#    *.md   — stage write-ups / guides
#    *.png  — screenshots
#    *.ps1  — lab scripts
#    scripts/newusers.csv — sample user input (no secrets)
# ===========================================================================
